# Desktop layer installed on top of the compositor + shell so a fresh login
# lands on a usable graphical session. The web browser is installed separately
# in steps/03-desktop.sh (it is selectable via --browser=).
#
# Kept deliberately short — anything language/framework-specific stays opt-in
# via the dev-tooling menu (see steps/tools/).

# Terminal emulator — matches the {{TERMINAL_COMMAND}} the deployed keybinds use
kitty
